{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10231150","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10231150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1023115001:1":{"text":"여기네요! <hpy>로리엣...!</hpy>","source_cn":"我们到了！<hpy>罗丽叶小——！</hpy>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2013EE89DC97F298","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1023115002:1":{"text":"쉿! 조용히! 밤바람으로 편지 내용을 들키지 않고 몰래 전해야 한다고요!","source_cn":"嘘！别声张！让晚风给罗丽叶捎个口信吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE82C7203629EA6C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1023115002":{"text":"쉿! 조용히! 밤바람으로 편지 내용을 들키지 않고 몰래 전해야 한다고요!","source_cn":"嘘！别声张！让晚风给罗丽叶捎个口信吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE82C7203629EA6C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1023115003:2":{"text":"‘바람아, 내가 얼마나 당신을 그리워하는지, <hpy>물을 떠난 물고기처럼 얼마나 고통스러운지 전해다오.</hpy>","source_cn":"“给我一阵清风替我告诉她——我多想念她，<hpy>宛如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB838B087EFF51D2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1023115004:1":{"text":"바람아, 내가 얼마나 당신을 사랑하는지, <hpy>그녀의 이름이 마음에 새겨진 것처럼 이 사랑하는 마음이 본능이라는 것을 전해다오.</hpy>","source_cn":"给我一阵清风替我告诉她——我多爱慕她，<hpy>她姓名...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C491DC9694DD679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1023115005:1":{"text":"당신과 함께 있으면 평범한 일상도 기적이 됩니다.","source_cn":"若与她同在，再平凡的日常，也会化作连绵不绝的奇迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECF5C2207E376247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1023115006:1":{"text":"당신이 없다면 아무리 아름다운 풍경이라도 의미가 없습니다.","source_cn":"若无她相伴，再美的风景，也变得黯然无光。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9DF44EB0F151ECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1023115007:1":{"text":"우리가 처음 만난 호숫가에서 정처 없이 서성이고 있습니다.","source_cn":"我在初定情缘的映湖旁徘徊，反反复复，流连忘返。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x860FD0C76657C9EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1023115008:1":{"text":"당신이 곁에 없으니 별조차 빛을 잃은 것 같군요...","source_cn":"与她相隔时，星光也不再闪烁……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22F987ECC1638D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1023115009:0":{"text":"<hpy>세상에 당신만큼 빛나는 별은 없으니까요. 당신에 관한 모든 것은 이 세상의 기적입니다.’</hpy>","source_cn":"<hpy>因为世上未曾有比她更璀璨的星星。一切与她相关...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF450325AA949BB9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","